flowchart TD
    U[User profile<br/>genre, mood, target energy,<br/>acoustic preference]
    D[(songs.csv)]
    L[Song loader]
    A[Recommendation Quality Agent<br/>plan the checks]
    S[Scoring engine<br/>score each song with reasons]
    R[Ranking engine<br/>sort top k songs]
    C[Quality checker<br/>check score strength, artist repeats,<br/>and recommendation variety]
    Q{Results pass checks?}
    F[Keep ranked list<br/>add confidence note]
    X[Adjust results<br/>apply diversity or low-confidence rule]
    O[Recommendations<br/>titles, scores, reasons, and agent log]
    T[Automated tests]
    H[Human review]

    D --> L
    U --> A
    L --> S
    A --> S
    S --> R
    R --> C
    C --> Q
    Q -->|Yes| F
    Q -->|No| X
    X --> O
    F --> O
    T -. checks scoring and agent rules .-> C
    H -. reviews logs and final list .-> O
